  "body": "## What changed\n\n**#637 step A** (M7.3, the carried stock on the field engine). The design is in https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/637 (research comment).\n\n- **New `crates/sim/src/stock_sim/field_carry.rs`:** `CarriedField` views an `SdfField` through a setup change's `LatticeTurn`. `distance(p) = field.distance(T⁻¹ p)`, and the same holds for `mesh_distance` and `inside`.\n  - **Why it's exact:** a signed distance is **invariant under rigid motion**, so nothing is re-sampled. That's the field analogue of `carry`'s \"re-index, never re-sample\".\n  - **Scope:** phase 1 stays on carry's eight lattice turns (Z kept on ±Z). Every other turn is still refused upstream by `CARRY_TURN_REFUSAL`.\n- **`LatticeTurn` gains:**\n  - `unapply`: the exact inverse (`m`'s transpose and Z's sign);\n  - `then`: composition, where signed permutations compose into signed permutations.\n- **Not yet wired:** nothing in `carry::Body` or the app uses it. That's steps B–D (B's design finding is posted on #637). So this PR is behaviour-neutral, new API plus tests.\n\n## How tested\n\n- **New `crates/sim/tests/field_carry.rs`, 3/3:**\n  - `unapply_inverts_apply_and_then_composes`: all 8 turns over a 3-D sample lattice, and every ordered pair composes correctly.\n  - `a_carried_field_reads_the_same_solid_through_every_turn`: a block with a slot cut through it (so the cut layer is live) reads **bit-identical** (`to_bits`) distance, mesh distance and parity at T(p) versus p, for all 8 turns.\n  - `carrying_twice_is_carrying_through_the_composed_turn`\n- **`scripts/gate.sh quick`:** the sim suites pass. Named: stock_backend_parity 13, stock_columns 3, and app setup_carry 9, carried_verify 8, rest_across_setups 7.\n- **Clippy** on sim and app with `-D warnings`: clean. No golden changed.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nSteps B–E (the floor read, clipping, the body enum with its agreement lane, and the app holders), per #637.\n\nChangelog: none (internal: a field view through a setup turn, not yet used)\n\nRefs #637\nRefs #26\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX\n",
